@startuml use-case-user
left to right direction
skinparam actorStyle awesome
actor User
rectangle "Sentinel Auth" {
  usecase "UC-01\nĐăng nhập" as login
  usecase "UC-02\nThực hiện MFA" as mfa
  usecase "UC-03\nXem / thu hồi phiên" as sessions
  usecase "UC-04\nXác nhận / báo cáo đăng nhập" as confirm
  usecase "UC-05\nQuản lý thiết bị tin cậy" as devices
}
User --> login
User --> mfa
User --> sessions
User --> confirm
User --> devices
mfa ..> login : <<extend>>\n[MFA_REQUIRED]
note right of login
Synchronous decision: ALLOW, MFA_REQUIRED or DENY.
Detection runs after the attempt is written to the outbox.
end note
@enduml
